# Wobble Rush 3D — Three.js r180+ Technical Reference Report

**Scope & version baseline.** Current stable is **r185** (`three@0.185.1`, published 2026-07-01), so every API below is verified valid for r180+. The `dev`-branch HEAD SHA at time of writing is **`1bc25777ac82579be2137f1f2e3f7d649595405f`**; all source permalinks below are immutable at that SHA.

- r185 release notes (confirms removal of deprecated code, MeshPhysicalMaterial still ships): https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/releases/tag/r185
- `package.json` (version `0.185.1`): https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mrdoob/three.js/dev/package.json
- Docs index confirming the exported constants `PCFSoftShadowMap`, `PCFShadowMap`, `VSMShadowMap`, `BasicShadowMap`, `ACESFilmicToneMapping`, `AgXToneMapping`, `NeutralToneMapping`, `SRGBColorSpace`, `LinearSRGBColorSpace`: https://threejs.org/docs/?q=MeshPhysicalMaterial

